#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/brightness_keyframable.rst:70
msgid ""
"Sets the intensity of the clip. Values range from 0 (completely dark) to 400 "
"(bright colors)"
msgstr ""
"Nastaví intenzitu klipu. Hodnoty sa pohybujú od 0 (úplne tmavé) do 400 "
"(žiarivé farby)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/brightness_keyframable.rst:75
msgid ""
"This effect was called *Brightness (keyframable)* before. It works "
"differently than the :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"color_image_correction/brightness` effect. At full intensity (400), the clip "
"is not glaringly bright (or white) but just has bright colors."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt sa predtým nazýval *Jas (s kľúčovými snímkami)*. Funguje odlišne "
"ako efekt :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/"
"brightness`. Pri plnej intenzite (400) klip nie je oslepujúco jasný (alebo "
"biely), ale má len jasné farby."

